WEBVTT

00:22.210 --> 00:26.020
That girl will bring 
misfortune to this village.

00:27.410 --> 00:31.840
Those with no stars should not be 
allowed to exist in this world.

00:33.050 --> 00:38.140
<b>On a Journey Alone</b>

01:44.430 --> 01:45.580
All right.

02:01.100 --> 02:05.210
<i>All they found was the hiding 
place closest to the village.</i>

02:06.560 --> 02:07.420
What?

02:07.420 --> 02:08.940
You're asking if it's difficult?

02:08.940 --> 02:12.170
Not after everything else. 
I gave up on happiness long ago.

02:16.980 --> 02:18.820
I'm an unwanted child.

02:19.580 --> 02:21.000
I was cast aside.

02:26.230 --> 02:27.770
Which is why I...

02:28.350 --> 02:30.180
I'm casting the village aside, too!

03:02.420 --> 03:04.830
If only I had skills like everyone else does.

03:04.830 --> 03:07.840
Like running or escaping or hiding!

03:07.840 --> 03:12.340
Oh, but if I'd had skills, none of this would 
have happened in the first place, right?

03:13.630 --> 03:18.100
What? "If I complain about the way I was 
born, nothing will ever start for me"?

03:18.100 --> 03:22.260
Did I experience something
like this in a past life, too?

03:29.300 --> 03:32.400
Oh, it's a dumping ground!

03:35.940 --> 03:39.200
Is there anything good in here?

03:52.560 --> 03:54.720
Anything good...

03:58.690 --> 04:00.760
Oh! Clothing!

04:04.640 --> 04:05.930
This is...

04:06.460 --> 04:09.890
a map! That might make my 
journey a little easier.

04:10.530 --> 04:13.390
This color. It's probably a blue potion.

04:13.390 --> 04:16.530
The color has changed quite a bit, 
but it might still be usable.

04:19.870 --> 04:22.040
I need all of these clothes.

04:23.820 --> 04:25.790
<i>I'm an unwanted child.</i>

04:26.370 --> 04:30.610
<i>An unwanted child living 
on trash no one wants anymore.</i>

04:31.200 --> 04:33.590
<i>Oh, the irony.</i>

04:37.260 --> 04:40.510
This is perfect. It's about time 
to feed the slimes.

04:49.890 --> 04:51.780
<i>That person's a tamer.</i>

04:56.370 --> 04:59.500
Huh? You're asking 
if I think the slimes are cute?

05:00.160 --> 05:03.320
Why would my past life want to 
think of monsters as cute?

05:03.930 --> 05:07.790
She's got a child's legs. 
She can't have gotten very far.

05:09.450 --> 05:11.930
The problem is figuring out 
which way she ran,

05:11.930 --> 05:15.590
but it's very likely that she went 
to the nearest village, Latoff.

05:16.550 --> 05:18.670
Then she should be around here somewhere,

05:18.670 --> 05:21.430
this Femicia girl.

05:21.430 --> 05:24.900
And the head of Latomi Village 
is making too much of this.

05:24.900 --> 05:27.030
Putting a bounty on a little girl?

05:27.430 --> 05:30.060
And he said dead or alive 
makes no difference.

05:32.720 --> 05:36.730
<i>The village head... intends to kill me.</i>

06:02.860 --> 06:03.800
Slimes?

06:04.720 --> 06:05.510
No!

06:11.180 --> 06:14.560
They are <i>not</i> cute. I hate this!

06:14.950 --> 06:18.940
"The forest is dangerous because 
of all the monsters"? I know that!

06:41.320 --> 06:43.170
I'm saved.

06:54.340 --> 06:57.120
It's old, so one isn't enough.

06:58.740 --> 07:02.980
"They're not just not cute, they're scary"? 
Well, they are monsters.

07:03.540 --> 07:08.500
I don't know. Is my past life talking 
about some other kind of slimes?

07:10.690 --> 07:11.970
It healed.

07:12.490 --> 07:14.620
They probably won't chase me anymore, right?

07:24.100 --> 07:26.770
Oh, how beautiful.

08:01.880 --> 08:03.430
<i>It feels so good!</i>

08:03.750 --> 08:05.530
<i>I've never done anything like this before.</i>

08:05.870 --> 08:09.250
<i>I've lived my whole life 
in hiding, so I've always...</i>

08:13.180 --> 08:15.870
<i>I won't hesitate. I'll be bold and resolute.</i>

08:15.870 --> 08:19.240
<i>That's right. It's what 
I always intended to do.</i>

08:19.240 --> 08:21.010
<i>And the fortune teller said so, too.</i>

08:36.430 --> 08:41.460
<i>She said to disguise myself as a boy 
when I travel because it'll be less dangerous.</i>

08:43.010 --> 08:46.880
"A girl traveling alone is just a 
sitting duck." What does that mean?

09:09.730 --> 09:11.370
I'll have to change my name, too.

09:11.930 --> 09:15.450
The name my father gave me, Femicia...

09:16.890 --> 09:17.880
I'll cast it aside.

09:19.250 --> 09:21.040
What name should I choose?

09:23.160 --> 09:24.680
Ivy?

09:24.680 --> 09:25.850
What's that?

09:26.460 --> 09:30.070
"The name of a plant that 
thrives even if you step on it"?

09:33.450 --> 09:34.630
Ivy...

09:35.600 --> 09:39.400
This is who I am from now on. Ivy.

09:42.510 --> 09:44.730
I wonder what will happen to me.

09:46.760 --> 09:49.240
"There's no point in worrying 
about the future."

09:49.680 --> 09:52.700
But everyone else has more 
of a purpose than I do.

09:53.360 --> 09:55.960
The person I am now has nothing.

09:56.430 --> 09:59.600
Yes, having nothing is easier.

10:36.460 --> 10:38.400
How cute!

10:53.330 --> 10:58.640
This isn't it either. Maybe it isn't 
in the monster compendium?

10:58.640 --> 10:59.940
There!

11:00.480 --> 11:02.760
A rare slime with no name.

11:03.210 --> 11:05.770
So, you don't have a name, little one?

11:08.900 --> 11:14.090
It's called "the weakest slime," 
or "the disintegrating slime."

11:15.890 --> 11:17.230
I see.

11:17.630 --> 11:21.390
So you're the weakest 
of your kind, just like me!

11:22.390 --> 11:25.880
But I don't want to call you "the weakest."

11:25.880 --> 11:28.750
Maybe I'll call you the disintegrating slime.

11:43.560 --> 11:47.520
My, you really are weak, aren't you?

11:52.800 --> 11:55.400
Could it be that you can't get back up?

11:59.830 --> 12:04.130
"This slime is so weak that it can 
disappear with just a poke."

12:04.130 --> 12:07.580
"If the wind blows too hard, 
it will disappear."

12:07.930 --> 12:09.960
What? It's that weak?

12:11.860 --> 12:16.020
<i>What should I do? 
Is it all right to touch it?</i>

12:16.020 --> 12:18.840
<i>If I set it upright, will it be all right?</i>

12:27.300 --> 12:28.640
<i>It's right side up!</i>

12:37.170 --> 12:38.880
I'm so glad!

12:38.880 --> 12:42.010
Let's see. This slime...

12:42.010 --> 12:47.290
"Because the slime is so weak, lifespans
under a day have been confirmed."

12:48.000 --> 12:51.330
You're going to disappear within a day?

12:53.170 --> 12:57.300
"As they are rarely encountered, 
and because their lives are so short,"

12:57.300 --> 13:03.320
"they've hardly been studied at all and most 
everything about them remains unknown."

13:03.320 --> 13:05.510
But that's just...

13:17.520 --> 13:18.440
Oh no!

13:28.700 --> 13:30.660
It's safe.

13:42.070 --> 13:44.890
Someone needs to protect you.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.310
Don't you think?

13:51.270 --> 13:52.980
Or do you not want that?

13:56.500 --> 13:57.900
I don't understand.

14:01.180 --> 14:05.570
I don't understand, 
but I'll be a windbreak for you.

14:06.420 --> 14:09.160
If you're destined to disappear within a day,

14:09.910 --> 14:12.340
then let's stay together until that happens.

14:21.380 --> 14:24.100
The gods don't play fair, do they?

14:24.100 --> 14:28.920
They create people who are happy, 
but they make people like us, too.

14:29.570 --> 14:31.980
You see, the humans here in Ordoguz,

14:31.980 --> 14:36.150
they all receive skills 
when they turn five years old.

14:36.150 --> 14:41.620
My father has two-star carpentry 
and processing skills.

14:41.620 --> 14:47.160
My mother has a two-star needlework skill 
and a one-star mending skill.

14:47.840 --> 14:51.120
No one knows what skills they'll receive,

14:51.120 --> 14:54.660
and the number of stars the skill has 
is up to the gods, too.

14:55.440 --> 15:00.550
Everyone's futures are decided by 
those skills and the number of stars.

15:04.780 --> 15:10.310
When I turned five, I received 
a skill, too. A taming skill.

15:11.490 --> 15:14.690
It's the ability to tame monsters 
and win them over.

15:15.200 --> 15:17.370
But it's a starless skill.

15:17.370 --> 15:20.570
That's right. I'm a starless tamer.

15:20.570 --> 15:24.280
Forget about monsters, 
I can't even tame small animals.

15:25.460 --> 15:30.240
When they found out I was starless, 
everyone's attitudes toward me changed.

15:30.900 --> 15:34.340
Even my kind father and mother...

15:34.810 --> 15:37.640
they stopped even looking at me.

15:38.660 --> 15:40.920
My food and my home, 
all of it was gone.

15:43.200 --> 15:45.480
The place I belonged was gone.

15:46.440 --> 15:51.600
But I do have one thing 
that other people don't have.

15:52.210 --> 15:55.150
Memories of my past life.

15:55.150 --> 15:59.610
Apparently, I'm a human who 
reincarnated here from a different world.

15:59.610 --> 16:02.740
They're hazy, but I have 
memories of that past life.

16:03.350 --> 16:06.190
They pretty much never prove useful though.

16:06.190 --> 16:09.460
They'll just suddenly whisper 
something that I can't understand.

16:09.460 --> 16:12.490
Huh? "Sometimes the things 
I say are useful"?

16:14.370 --> 16:17.460
And there was someone who was kind to me.

16:17.820 --> 16:19.420
The fortune teller.

16:19.420 --> 16:23.290
She gave me lots of different books 
and taught me lots of different things.

16:23.830 --> 16:27.500
This magic bag was given to me 
by that fortune teller, too!

16:27.910 --> 16:30.410
It's an older model, so it 
doesn't perform very well,

16:30.410 --> 16:35.700
but it can hold lots of stuff and everything 
inside gets lighter, so it's really handy.

16:36.920 --> 16:38.630
It helped me survive in the forest.

16:39.170 --> 16:42.440
The fortune teller died recently.

16:45.130 --> 16:48.050
I've really lost everyone.

16:48.930 --> 16:53.280
There isn't anyone who will look at me now.

16:55.560 --> 16:59.910
The people from the village 
are trying to kill me.

17:00.400 --> 17:04.090
The village head, and my father... everyone.

17:05.020 --> 17:07.540
Even though I didn't do anything.

17:08.210 --> 17:10.520
Even though I can't do anything.

17:13.030 --> 17:15.750
It's all because I was born starless.

17:15.750 --> 17:17.630
It's because I can't do anything.

17:18.610 --> 17:22.060
Is being starless really that bad?

17:22.060 --> 17:24.730
Is it really something 
that should be hated so much?

17:27.830 --> 17:32.860
Is this world saying 
that it doesn't want me?

17:36.940 --> 17:40.550
And you, little one, were born with 
the fate of disappearing within a day.

17:42.020 --> 17:44.400
This world isn't fair, is it?

17:46.000 --> 17:47.210
Right?

17:49.680 --> 17:51.080
It's not?

17:51.080 --> 17:53.240
Well, I don't know.

17:53.240 --> 17:57.140
I don't know, but I'm glad to have met you.

17:57.140 --> 18:00.640
I don't know, but it's all right 
to feel this way, isn't it?

18:01.620 --> 18:05.730
Yes. You're my very first friend!

18:06.800 --> 18:09.730
So, let's stay together until the very end!

18:29.520 --> 18:32.630
Where... Where are you?

18:35.760 --> 18:36.590
Little one...

18:39.200 --> 18:41.600
Where did you go?

18:46.280 --> 18:47.510
It can't be...

18:49.000 --> 18:51.580
If the world says it doesn't want you...

18:51.910 --> 18:54.090
is there nothing you can do about it?

18:56.540 --> 18:58.230
"Lonely"?

18:58.230 --> 19:01.790
I suppose I am. I thought 
I was used to it, though.

19:04.630 --> 19:08.130
That's right. I'm used to this.

19:11.060 --> 19:12.750
I'm not lonely.

19:13.160 --> 19:15.350
I was alone to begin with.

19:15.350 --> 19:19.430
I'll do what the fortune teller told me 
to do and head for the royal capital.

19:26.810 --> 19:29.710
I managed to get my hands 
on a map, after all.

19:38.210 --> 19:39.200
It's you!

19:42.050 --> 19:45.080
You're alive! You didn't disappear!

19:47.900 --> 19:51.800
So, disappearing within 
a day was a lie, wasn't it?

19:52.950 --> 19:54.580
If it's a lie, then...

20:04.850 --> 20:06.140
There it is.

20:06.880 --> 20:09.630
"When taming a monster,"

20:10.650 --> 20:14.400
"first pass a little magical 
energy to the monster."

20:15.090 --> 20:18.680
"If the monster accepts it, 
a glow will appear."

20:18.680 --> 20:22.600
"Name the monster while it's in that state."

20:23.280 --> 20:27.250
"If successful, a mark showing that 
it's tamed will appear on the monster."

20:28.170 --> 20:30.480
I'm a starless tamer.

20:31.420 --> 20:33.000
Can I really do this?

20:35.510 --> 20:38.070
Can I do this?

20:40.290 --> 20:44.530
<i>When I'm alone, I can breathe</i>

20:44.530 --> 20:48.670
<i>In a world with no one 
but me, I feel at ease</i>

20:49.320 --> 20:53.650
<i>But I think the truth is</i>

20:53.650 --> 20:59.600
<i>That I've been waiting for 
morning's light to break through</i>

20:57.370 --> 20:59.600
<i>(Where could it be?)</i>

20:59.600 --> 21:02.920
<i>Beyond the edges of a yet unknown map</i>

20:59.930 --> 21:01.780
<i>Did I do it?</i>

21:02.170 --> 21:04.120
<i>I have to give it a name.</i>

21:02.920 --> 21:07.270
<i>That's where I'll find a place 
where I can live</i>

21:05.530 --> 21:07.270
<i>(If it exists...)</i>

21:05.530 --> 21:09.440
<i>It's a blue color, so... Ao? Or, Blue?</i>

21:07.270 --> 21:09.440
<i>I'd like to go there</i>

21:09.440 --> 21:13.010
<i>And with trembling legs, 
I take a step forward</i>

21:12.690 --> 21:14.470
<i>Blue sky...</i>

21:13.010 --> 21:17.840
<i>I'm on a journey without end</i>

21:15.570 --> 21:16.670
That's it!

21:17.840 --> 21:20.120
<i>I'll take everything I feel</i>

21:18.260 --> 21:21.260
Your name is Sora! It means sky!

21:20.120 --> 21:22.120
<i>And pack it into my once empty bag</i>

21:22.120 --> 21:23.930
<i>I'll go as far as I need to</i>

21:23.930 --> 21:26.170
<i>On this journey to find myself</i>

21:26.170 --> 21:28.330
<i>And everything I'm given along the way</i>

21:28.330 --> 21:32.670
<i>Will slowly fill my heart to the brim</i>

21:34.550 --> 21:35.900
It worked!

21:41.670 --> 21:43.700
Your name is Sora.

21:42.450 --> 21:46.810
<i>Now, I'm not all alone anymore</i>

21:43.700 --> 21:45.030
My name is...

21:46.810 --> 21:51.610
<i>Because I've met new, dear friends</i>

21:48.810 --> 21:52.370
<i>That's right. I'm not Femicia anymore.</i>

21:51.610 --> 21:56.480
<i>(Maybe we can understand each other 
because we're alike. Isn't it strange?)</i>

21:52.370 --> 21:56.040
<i>I cast aside that name 
along with that village.</i>

21:56.040 --> 21:59.260
<i>The name of a plant that thrives 
even if it's stomped on.</i>

21:56.480 --> 21:59.690
<i>Your bright laughter gives me courage</i>

21:59.260 --> 22:02.050
<i>My name is Ivy!</i>

21:59.690 --> 22:03.950
<i>(I feel like I'm wrapped up 
snugly by your warmth)</i>

22:02.050 --> 22:04.590
Sora, I'm looking forward to 
knowing you better!

22:03.950 --> 22:09.110
<i>From now on, let's stay 
together forever and ever</i>

22:11.640 --> 22:15.220
<i>You are not alone</i>

22:15.220 --> 22:18.770
<i>Open your eyes</i>

22:18.770 --> 22:20.560
<i>That’s the way</i>

22:20.560 --> 22:25.280
<i>You’ll be fine</i>

22:25.280 --> 22:29.320
<i>All of us are here now</i>

22:29.320 --> 22:35.160
<i>You’re something special</i>

22:35.160 --> 22:42.420
<i>Please just relax, and move forward</i>

22:43.420 --> 22:47.840
<i>Because you are here now</i>

22:47.840 --> 22:52.720
<i>The world is so beautiful</i>

22:52.720 --> 22:58.430
<i>This place is full of light</i>

22:58.430 --> 23:05.070
<i>You had countless nights of tears</i>

23:05.070 --> 23:12.450
<i>But you walked all the way here</i>

23:12.450 --> 23:18.790
<i>If it’s dark we’ll be your light</i>

23:18.790 --> 23:28.630
<i>You see the end of this road 
is crystal clear</i>
